Third-party data

data/indpensim_extract.csv.gz is NOT covered by the MIT License above. It is a
subset of the IndPenSim dataset by Goldrick et al. (Mendeley Data,
doi:10.17632/pdnjz7zz5x.2), licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes made: only 10 of the original columns are kept, the batch-number
column is read by position, and temperature is converted from kelvin to
degrees Celsius.
